					<![CDATA[
						 <p>The &quot;is&quot; is struckthrough here: it's intending to convey that the Foundation originally thought it was a watering can; but after the interview they discovered it was something else.</p> <p>(That said, the strikethrough is really not obvious here :/)</p> 
				 	]]>
