				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 05 Dec 2019 15:21:34 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>csljr1</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>5904346</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Not sure if this is deliberate or something that was just missed (emphasis is mine):</p> <blockquote> <p>Description: SCP-1294-J <strong>is appears to be</strong></p> </blockquote> <p>I'm guessing it was meant to be &quot;SCP-1294-J is/appears to be&quot;, with a slash separating the two (or one of them and not the other), but I didn't want to presume anything by making the change without consulting the author.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
